── General
?        help                                                       
q        close, or quit at the root                                 
esc      back out one level                                         
ctrl+c   cancel the running command, else quit                      
'        jump to a labeled row                                      
ctrl+o   jump list back                                             
ctrl+i   jump list forward                                          
── Move
gg       top                                                        
G        bottom                                                     
j/down   down a line                                                
k/up     up a line                                                  
ctrl+d   half a page down                                           
ctrl+u   half a page up                                             
── Files
enter    diff the file                                              
R        restore (discard) the file                                 
s        squash the file into…                                      
x        resolve the file's conflict                                
space    stage or unstage the file (in @)                           
c        commit what is staged (in @)                               
*        history: the changes that touched the file                 jj log -r 'files(<file>) & (::(@ | <rev>) | <revset>)'
